<title>ISRAEL: Death toll 29 Arabs, five Israelis at 1215 gmt.</title>
<headline>Death toll 29 Arabs, five Israelis at 1215 gmt.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli troops shot dead 24 Palestinians in clashes on Thursday, taking the death toll in two days of fighting to 29 Palestinians, medical sources in the Palestinian areas said.</p>
<p>Israeli army radio said five Israelis were killed in the clashes on Thursday. Israel Radio said at least two of them were soldiers in the Gaza Strip.</p>
